      "source": "#r \u0022nuget: libphonenumber-csharp\u0022 \r\nopen PhoneNumbers                 \r\ntype PhoneNumber with \r\n    static member Parse(numberString:string) = PhoneNumberUtil.GetInstance().Parse(numberString, \u0022US\u0022)\r\n",
