      "source": "#r \u0022nuget: NLanguageTag\u0022\r\nopen NLanguageTag\r\n\r\ntype NLanguageTag.LanguageTag with \r\n    member this.asString = this.ToString()\r\ntype InitialTextDirection =\r\n    | Ltr\r\n    | Rtl\r\n    member this.asString = this.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()\r\n\r\n",
